/.idea/
/result/

dataset/

# ==============================
# 1. Python 缓存与运行产生的临时文件
# ==============================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so

# ==============================
# 2. 虚拟环境 (绝对不能提交！)
# ==============================
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ==============================
# 3. 编辑器与 IDE 配置文件
# ==============================
.idea/      
.vscode/    
*.swp
*.swo

# ==============================
# 4. 深度学习模型权重与 Checkpoints
# ==============================
# 你的 MMoE/PLE 模型跑出来的权重通常很大，坚决拦截
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.h5
*.pb

# ==============================
# 5. 数据集与日志文件
# ==============================
# 像 Census-Income 这种动辄几十兆的数据不要进 Git
*.csv
*.json
*.txt
!requirements.txt  # 注意：排除 requirements.txt，因为它是配方，必须提交
*.log
logs/
tb_logs/           # TensorBoard 日志

# ==============================
# 6. CensusIncome 阶段 2 协议产物（spec 9.2）
# ==============================
# 权重 / 指标 / 日志 / 划分索引一律不入库；SUMMARY.md 是唯一入库产物
artifacts/census_stage2/stage1
artifacts/census_stage2/runs
artifacts/census_stage2/splits
!artifacts/census_stage2/SUMMARY.md

# ==============================
# 7. CensusIncome 阶段 1 梯度冲突审计产物（预注册 §4）
# ==============================
# 审计 run 的**文本**证据入库（audit.json / report.md / prereg.md 快照 / stdout.log）：
# 它们是 NO_ACTION 判定的原始依据，确定性、无时间戳、无绝对路径、体积可控。
# 划分指纹 JSON 入库（可校验）；划分索引 .npz（可由 SPLIT_SEED 确定性重建）与权重一律不入库。
!artifacts/census_stage1_grad/runs/**
!artifacts/census_stage1_grad/splits/**/split_fingerprint.json
!artifacts/census_stage1_grad/SUMMARY.md
artifacts/census_stage1_grad/**/*.npz
artifacts/census_stage1_grad/**/*.pt
artifacts/census_stage1_grad/**/*.pth
